---
---
<section id="inicio" class="px-4 pt-24 md:pt-28">
  <div class="mesh mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-[2.5rem] px-6 py-16 md:px-14 md:py-24">
    <!-- Manchas de color que se mezclan -->
    <div class="mesh-blob -left-24 -top-24 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] bg-lemon/90"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob right-[-10%] top-[-20%] h-[32rem] w-[32rem] bg-sonic/70 [animation-delay:-6s]"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob bottom-[-30%] left-[30%] h-[30rem] w-[30rem] bg-sea [animation-delay:-12s]"></div>

    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr]">
      <div class="animate-fade-up">
        <p class="mb-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-white/70 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold">
          👋 Hola, soy Aissa
        </p>

        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[0.95] tracking-tight md:text-7xl">
          Construyo productos que la gente
          <span class="relative inline-block">
            usa de verdad.
            <svg class="absolute -bottom-3 left-0 w-full" viewBox="0 0 300 14" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 9C60 3 140 2 298 7" stroke="#0F1B2D" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg text-ink/75 md:text-xl">
          Desarrollador Full-Stack en Alicante. Diseño, programo y lanzo mis propias plataformas,
          y entre medias enseño a otros a hacer lo mismo.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#proyectos" class="btn-dark">Ver mis proyectos ↓</a>
          <a href="/job/CV_ISSA_MAYIMOUT.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn-light">Descargar CV</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Logo + pegatinas -->
      <div class="relative mx-auto aspect-square w-64 md:w-full md:max-w-sm">
        <img src="/icons/brand/aissa-logo.png" alt="Logo de Aissa" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-8 drop-shadow-[0_20px_30px_rgb(15_27_45/0.25)]" />
        <span class="sticker absolute -left-4 top-6 -rotate-6 bg-lemon">⚡ Full-Stack</span>
        <span class="sticker absolute -right-2 top-1/2 rotate-3 bg-white">🧑‍🏫 Profe desde 2022</span>
        <span class="sticker absolute bottom-4 left-2 -rotate-2 bg-sea">🚀 3 productos online</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
